#*******************************************************************************************************
# Filename              : DRC_CifSolXfer.scr
# Description           : This script is used to transfer cifs from one primary sol id to another
# Input                 : 
# Output                : workflow
# Called Script         : 
# Calling Script        :

# Modification History
# Sl. #           Date             Author             Modification           Version
# -----          -----            --------          ----------------        ---------
